{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Operator decision (2026-08-10): add per-lane timeout budgets calibrated from historical runtime data, with a generous allowance for legitimate live-service variance. Do not copy one blanket timeout across all external and live lanes."},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1786387542607509001,"uuid":"f5b90834-1631-47c3-b126-8c641d051b4a"}